    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Explaining the choice",
     "texto": [
      "**Fordi** introduces a reason and follows the usual subject-verb order: **Jeg velger bussen fordi den er billigst** («I choose the bus because it's the cheapest»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Justifying",
     "texto": [
      "**Å spare penger** means to save money. **Billigst** means «the cheapest»; **raskest**, «the fastest». **Miljøvennlig** describes something environmentally friendly."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
